			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783413030188,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "What you need to know\n\n- LIFO vs FIFO: Core ordering mechanics (Stacks vs. Queues).\n- Operation Tracking: Execution states of push, pop, enqueue, dequeue, and peek.\n- Linked List Backing: Mapping Stacks to head and Queues to head/tail pointers for \n  O(1) efficiency.\n- Edge Cases: Preventing runtime errors and handling underflow on empty structures.",
			"rawText": "What you need to know\n\n- LIFO vs FIFO: Core ordering mechanics (Stacks vs. Queues).\n- Operation Tracking: Execution states of push, pop, enqueue, dequeue, and peek.\n- Linked List Backing: Mapping Stacks to head and Queues to head/tail pointers for \n  O(1) efficiency.\n- Edge Cases: Preventing runtime errors and handling underflow on empty structures.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "JOBOkp3S2hrBkvhLhPZ0e",
			"originalText": "What you need to know\n\n- LIFO vs FIFO: Core ordering mechanics (Stacks vs. Queues).\n- Operation Tracking: Execution states of push, pop, enqueue, dequeue, and peek.\n- Linked List Backing: Mapping Stacks to head and Queues to head/tail pointers for \n  O(1) efficiency.\n- Edge Cases: Preventing runtime errors and handling underflow on empty structures.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
