			"versionNonce": 636729108,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783413030188,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Go deeper\n\n- Array Implementations: Tracking fixed boundaries with a changing top index.\n- Circular Queues: Implementing pointer wrap-around via modulo arithmetic: \n  (rear + 1) % capacity.\n- Expression Parsing: Converting infix to postfix and evaluating equations via \n  operand stacks.\n- Dual-Stack Queues: Simulating a Queue with two Stacks and verifying the amortized \n  O(1) runtime.",
			"rawText": "Go deeper\n\n- Array Implementations: Tracking fixed boundaries with a changing top index.\n- Circular Queues: Implementing pointer wrap-around via modulo arithmetic: \n  (rear + 1) % capacity.\n- Expression Parsing: Converting infix to postfix and evaluating equations via \n  operand stacks.\n- Dual-Stack Queues: Simulating a Queue with two Stacks and verifying the amortized \n  O(1) runtime.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "ikzFSSk1PACzB0LmkdZDj",
			"originalText": "Go deeper\n\n- Array Implementations: Tracking fixed boundaries with a changing top index.\n- Circular Queues: Implementing pointer wrap-around via modulo arithmetic: \n  (rear + 1) % capacity.\n- Expression Parsing: Converting infix to postfix and evaluating equations via \n  operand stacks.\n- Dual-Stack Queues: Simulating a Queue with two Stacks and verifying the amortized \n  O(1) runtime.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
