		{
			"id": "2DVIfDBX",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -245.86953863576514,
			"y": 271.5752924041733,
			"width": 978.9988403320312,
			"height": 150,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0J",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1948743444,
			"version": 657,
			"versionNonce": 445896236,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783411728081,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Enqueue: Appends an item to the Back (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list append).\n2. Dequeue: Removes and returns the item at the Front (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list \n   deleteHead).\n3. Peek: Examines the payload at the Front boundary without changing data states.\n4. IsEmpty: Evaluates whether active references exist.\n5. GetSize: Computes the runtime length of the queue.",
			"rawText": "1. Enqueue: Appends an item to the Back (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list append).\n2. Dequeue: Removes and returns the item at the Front (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list \n   deleteHead).\n3. Peek: Examines the payload at the Front boundary without changing data states.\n4. IsEmpty: Evaluates whether active references exist.\n5. GetSize: Computes the runtime length of the queue.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "HbfEdqI9RmmCK-iTGNIsN",
			"originalText": "1. Enqueue: Appends an item to the Back (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list append).\n2. Dequeue: Removes and returns the item at the Front (Equivalent to an O(1) linked list \n   deleteHead).\n3. Peek: Examines the payload at the Front boundary without changing data states.\n4. IsEmpty: Evaluates whether active references exist.\n5. GetSize: Computes the runtime length of the queue.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "79oDT7Z4",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -245.32699459718515,
			"y": 33.245345701757174,
			"width": 1017.1700825739869,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0L",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1889255956,
			"version": 385,
			"versionNonce": 341090068,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783410166317,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A structured checkout queue at a retail storefront. \nThe first consumer to line up is the first consumer systematically provisioned service and\npermitted to leave. \nNew arrivals append themselves to the back of the line.",
			"rawText": "A structured checkout queue at a retail storefront. \nThe first consumer to line up is the first consumer systematically provisioned service and permitted to leave. \nNew arrivals append themselves to the back of the line.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "A structured checkout queue at a retail storefront. \nThe first consumer to line up is the first consumer systematically provisioned service and permitted to leave. \nNew arrivals append themselves to the back of the line.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
