			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "The Problem It Solves: Apparent Fullness",
			"rawText": "The Problem It Solves: Apparent Fullness",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "The Problem It Solves: Apparent Fullness",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
		{
			"id": "JBEQote3",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 861.6287244917967,
			"y": 193.33541025709587,
			"width": 1007.0142448370609,
			"height": 125,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1f",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 929550612,
			"version": 226,
			"versionNonce": 512549164,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783415822163,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "In a standard linear array queue, dequeuing an item increments the front pointer forward,\npermanently orphaning the memory cells behind it. \nEventually, the back pointer strikes the final index of the array (capacity - 1). The\nsystem flags a Queue Overflow error on subsequent insertions, even if the slots at the\nbeginning of the array are completely empty.",
			"rawText": "In a standard linear array queue, dequeuing an item increments the front pointer forward, permanently orphaning the memory cells behind it. \nEventually, the back pointer strikes the final index of the array (capacity - 1). The system flags a Queue Overflow error on subsequent insertions, even if the slots at the beginning of the array are completely empty.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "In a standard linear array queue, dequeuing an item increments the front pointer forward, permanently orphaning the memory cells behind it. \nEventually, the back pointer strikes the final index of the array (capacity - 1). The system flags a Queue Overflow error on subsequent insertions, even if the slots at the beginning of the array are completely empty.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "Ru1hqLIU",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 860.0292104535457,
			"y": 350.2203703295337,
			"width": 970.8225271233719,
			"height": 75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1g",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1241361556,
			"version": 176,
			"versionNonce": 101586836,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783415822163,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Shifting all remaining elements forward to reclaim this dead space requires an expensive\nO(n) linear operation. A circular queue resolves this bottleneck, maintaining an O(1)\nbaseline.",
			"rawText": "Shifting all remaining elements forward to reclaim this dead space requires an expensive O(n) linear operation. A circular queue resolves this bottleneck, maintaining an O(1) baseline.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Shifting all remaining elements forward to reclaim this dead space requires an expensive O(n) linear operation. A circular queue resolves this bottleneck, maintaining an O(1) baseline.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
