			"updated": 1783415840160,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Advance Back Pointer: back = (back + 1) % capacity;\n- Advance Front Pointer: front = (front + 1) % capacity;\n- System Full Check: size == capacity;\n- System Empty Check: size == 0;",
			"rawText": "- Advance Back Pointer: back = (back + 1) % capacity;\n- Advance Front Pointer: front = (front + 1) % capacity;\n- System Full Check: size == capacity;\n- System Empty Check: size == 0;",
